sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Browser
    participant GW as OpenShift Gateway<br/>(Envoy) 443/TCP
    participant RBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant WB as Workbench Container<br/>(JupyterLab 8888 /<br/>Code Server 8787 /<br/>RStudio 8787)
    participant KFP as KFP Pipeline<br/>Controller
    participant RT as Runtime Container<br/>(Minimal/DS/PyTorch/TF)
    participant ExtData as External Data Sources<br/>(S3, Databases)
    participant GH as GitHub<br/>443/TCP
    participant PAC as PipelinesAsCode<br/>(Tekton)
    participant Quay as quay.io Registry<br/>443/TCP

    Note over User,WB: Flow 1: User Workbench Access
    User->>GW: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS 1.2+, OIDC Auth
    GW->>RBAC: HTTPS/8443<br/>TLS, Bearer Token
    RBAC->>WB: HTTP/8888 or 8787<br/>No encryption (localhost)<br/>Pre-authenticated
    WB-->>RBAC: Response
    RBAC-->>GW: Response
    GW-->>User: HTTPS Response

    Note over KFP,ExtData: Flow 2: Pipeline Runtime Execution
    KFP->>RT: Create Pod<br/>ServiceAccount auth
    RT->>ExtData: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS 1.2+<br/>AWS IAM / Credentials
    ExtData-->>RT: Data response
    RT-->>KFP: Execution complete

    Note over GH,Quay: Flow 3: Image Build (Konflux)
    GH->>PAC: PR webhook event<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>GitHub webhook secret
    PAC->>PAC: CEL filter evaluates<br/>changed files
    PAC->>Quay: Build & push image<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Registry credentials
    PAC->>Quay: skopeo inspect (validation)<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+
